m-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Solar Wallet</strong></span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Mobile/Web</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Buena, con control de claves</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://solarwallet.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" style=\"--wt-inline-link-underline-color-override:rgb(var(--ds-rgb-link));--wt-inline-link-color-override:rgb(var(--ds-rgb-link))\">Solar</a></span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Lobstr</strong></span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Mobile/Web</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Interfaz amigable</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://lobstr.co/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\" style=\"--wt-inline-link-underline-color-override:rgb(var(--ds-rgb-link));--wt-inline-link-color-override:rgb(var(--ds-rgb-link))\">Lobstr</a></span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Ventajas</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Fáciles de usar para transacciones frecuentes.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Riesgos</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Vulnerables a hackeos si no se protegen adecuadamente.</span></p></div><div id=\"wallets-fros-cold-wallets\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h4 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx5\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Wallets Fríos (Cold Wallets)</strong></span></h4></div><div class=\"b7oqx90\" style=\"--cell-width:33.333333333333336%\"><table class=\"b7oqx91\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"_200kro0\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Dispositivo</strong></span></p></div></th><th class=\"_200kro0\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Tipo</strong></span></p></div></th><th class=\"_200kro0\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Seguridad</strong></span></p></div></th><th class=\"_200kro0\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Precio</strong></span></p></div></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Ledger Nano X</strong></span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Hardware</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Máxima (offline)</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">~$149</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Trezor Model T</strong></span></p></div></td><td cl